                    "[SMUG][CRITICAL] SSRF via request smuggling at %s - "
                    "smuggled request with Host: %s returned cloud metadata "
                    "content; backend routed the injected request to the internal "
                    "metadata service - SSRF + request smuggling chain confirmed" % (
                        base, _ih.decode()),
                    "type=%s internal_host=%s" % (_smug_type, _ih.decode()),
                    "SMUG_SSRF:" + _ih.decode(),
